  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n**Given**:\n\n12:168\n\n__**12²**__ + 24 = 168\n\n__144____** + 24**__ = 168\n\n168 = 168 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n11:145\n\n__112__ + 24 = 145\n\n__121____ + 24__ = 145\n\n145 = 145 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo, checking each option one by one:\n\nOption 1) 5:61\n\n__52__ + 24 = 61\n\n__25____ + 24__ = 61\n\n49 ≠ 61 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) 14:172 \n\n__142__ + 24 = 172\n\n__196____ + 24__ = 172\n\n220 ≠ 172 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) 16:232\n\n__162__ + 24 = 232\n\n__256____ + 24__ = 232\n\n280 ≠ 232 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) 8:88\n\n__82__ + 24 = 88\n\n__64____ + 24__ = 88\n\n**88 = 88 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nThus, out of all the options '8:88' follows the same logic as given.\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
